{:id "0017-look-polish"
 :title "Look polish: tighter rhythm, no orphan glyph, a legible Send"
 :lupa/deps #{"0016-look-title-sequence"}
 :lupa/area :ui
 :lupa/risk :low
 :goal "The first screenshot of the title-sequence look (foreman's review,
        out/e2e/reduced-motion.png) reads well but wastes space and shows
        three flaws. Fix them without changing the direction."
 :scope ["public/css/halfahead.css" "src/halfahead/app/views.cljc"
         "test/halfahead/app/views_test.cljc"]
 :design "1. Rhythm: a one-line turn currently takes ~140px of height at a
             1280px-wide viewport. Tighten the vertical space between turns
             to roughly half (consecutive turns read as one scene; keep the
             hairline rule and the title's generous space).
          2. Orphan glyph: the presence area shows Scout's idle diamond on
             its own above the composer, with no text. Show the presence
             line's glyph only while the agent is thinking, beside its
             'Scout is thinking…' text; idle shows nothing there (the
             glyph in the header and beside Scout's messages stays).
          3. Send: the enabled button's label meets 4.5:1 contrast against
             its fill (state the pair in a CSS comment); the disabled state
             is visibly disabled (e.g. outline only) rather than a paler
             fill.
          4. Preferences: labels use the same label type as the other
             labels (the condensed, letter-spaced style), at least 0.875rem."
 :acceptance
 ["View test: with presence idle, the presence line contains no glyph; with
   presence thinking, it contains the glyph (data-state \"thinking\") and the
   text"
  "CSS: the enabled Send colour pair and its contrast are stated in a
   comment and are at least 4.5:1; the disabled style differs from enabled
   by more than lightness alone"
  "`bb e2e` passes; the final message reports the pixel height of the first
   two turns in out/e2e/conversation.png versus before (~140px each)"
  "`bb test` stays green"]
 :non-goals
 ["Do not edit core, perform, the shell, the schema, or the worker"
  "No new features; no change of direction"]
 :context ["docs/research/conversation-design.md" "public/css/halfahead.css"
           "src/halfahead/app/views.cljc" "test/halfahead/app/views_test.cljc"]
 :budget-usd 6.0}
